<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079005/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079006" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute><choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Celeber.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice> Viro
      <lb/>Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> Petrus <choice><abbr>Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Antonius</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Quoniam <rs key="B_991170515152605501" type="letter">literis</rs> tuis perhumanissimis IX Aprilis ad me
      <lb/>missis facultatem ad Te scribendi mihi largitus es; hinc
      <lb/>occasionem arripio perpauca ad <choice><sic>Temmetipsum</sic><corr>Temet ipsum</corr></choice> scribendi de motu Fluidorum
      <lb/>per canales conicos ut tuis doctrinis et speculationibus ins<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tructus doctior evadam. De quibus antequam verba faciam Tibi
      <lb/>maximas refero gratias pro <choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>is, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> respondisti ad problema
      <lb/>de velocitate Liquoris per canalem elasticum data vi impulsi.
      <lb/>Fluat ergo Liquor quicunque per canalem conicum, sive
      <lb/>per conum excavatum rectum aut obliquum <formula>ABDF</formula> <figure facs="../images/figures/1079010_01.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"><figDesc>Darstellung eines zylinderförmigen Kanals.</figDesc></figure> ab orifi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cio maiori <formula>BF</formula> in angustius <formula>AD</formula> per longitudinem; deter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>minandum est quales partes Liquoris incidant in super<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ficiem canalis et quales non incidant in utroque casu
      <lb/>coni recti scilicet aut obliqui: pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terea determinandus
      <lb/>est angulus incidenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, et impressio Fluidi in superfi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ciem canalis (qui potest considerari primo durus dein<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>de elasticus) pariter etiam determinanda venit: Suppono
      <lb/><choice><sic>fuidum</sic><corr>fluidum</corr></choice> vi constanti et uniformi propelli
      <lb/>per ipsum canalem <formula>ABDF</formula> cuius axis <formula>HG</formula>; line<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/><formula>CA</formula>, <formula>ED</formula> line<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quas tra<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>iciunt aliqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Liquoris partes
      <lb/>incidentes in superficiem canalis. Tandem determinan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>da est resistentia quam eiusdem offendunt Liquoris partes
      <lb/>occurrentes superficiei canalis tam in cono recto
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m in obliquo. Peto deinde abs Te Vir Celeberri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>me anne (si canalis <formula>ABDF</formula> orificium minus <formula>AD</formula> sit
      <lb/>angustissimum) anne inquam immineat periculum
<pb facs="1079007" n="2"/>
      <lb/>occlusionis e<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> quod Liquor per ipsum fluit; et ex eo fiat
      <lb/>validior occlusio quo vis fluxus fuerit intensior? Conside<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>retur nunc in fig. 2 <figure facs="../images/figures/1079010_02.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"><figDesc>Weitere Darstellung eines zylinderförmigen Kanals.</figDesc></figure> canalis <formula>ABDF</formula> cylindricus qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ritur
      <lb/>annon aliqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> et quant<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> partes liquoris dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> vi uni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>formiter per ipsum canalem cylindricum
      <lb/>fluentis incident in latera ipsius canalis. Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tere<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/>determinanda est proportio resistenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quam offendit
      <lb/>Liquor fluens in canali conico recto aut obliquo ad
      <lb/>resistentiam quam patitur in canali cylindrico
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>que alto. Fluat tandem Liquor per (fig. 3) <figure facs="../images/figures/1079010_03.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"><figDesc>Darstellung entgegengesetzter Flüssigkeitsgeschwindigkeit in einem zylinderförmigen Kanal.</figDesc></figure> per
      <lb/>axem <formula>AB</formula> alicuius canalis cylindrici data vi constan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ter et uniformiter agente: qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro num considerari
      <lb/>possit in dicto canali motus compositus ita ut Liquor
      <lb/>pulsus continu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> a vi impellente per <formula>AB</formula> motum
      <lb/>etiam habeat per <formula>AD</formula> et per consequens fluat
      <lb/>per diagonalem <formula>AC</formula>. Doctor <rs key="pers_DE-588-117659606" type="person"><choice><sic>Chyne</sic><corr>Cheyne</corr></choice></rs> Anglus adhi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bere conatur doctrinam motus compositi pro ex<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>plicanda Secretione Animali. Etenim asserit se<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cretionem Fluidorum fieri in arteriis duorum
      <lb/>motu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> compositione motu nempe propagato
      <lb/>per canalis longitudinem et altero motu transver<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>so propagat per canalis latera: quamobrem suppo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nere videtur quod motuum compositio non tam
      <lb/>in canali cylindrico ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m etiam in conico (arte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> enim sunt conic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>) locum habere possit quo
      <lb/>fluxu Liquoris cuiuslibet pulsi per
<pb facs="1079008" n="3"/>
      <lb/>dictor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> canali<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> longitudinem. Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so ut hanc rem
      <lb/>attent<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> consideres. Etenim ipse <rs key="pers_DE-588-117659606" type="person"><choice><sic>Chyne</sic><corr>Cheyne</corr></choice></rs> subdit separationem Fluidi a Sangui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>neo amni qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m facillim<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> secuturam, si canalis secernens angulum <metamark/><add>semirectum cum arteria constituat. Quod an
      <lb/>verum sit plan<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> ignoro.</add><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Der Zusatz von «semirectum» bis «ignoro» steht auf der dritten Manuskriptseite im freien Raum vor dem Absatz «Fluida pressiones suas». Zwei Sternchen verbinden ihn mit der Einfügestelle.</note>
      <lb/>Tandem etiam atque etiam rogo ut sequentem mihi amo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>veas difficultatem.</p>
  <p>Fluida pressiones suas communicare secundum lineas
      <lb/>continentibus perpendiculares demonstrasti in perexi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mio Tuo opere <rs key="biblio_RTB4565Q" type="biblio">Manuari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Nautic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs>. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c propositio
      <lb/>estne intelligenda de solis Fluidis stagnantibus in statu
      <lb/>manenti positis nullisque viribus pulsis; an<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ne etiam de Fluidis viribus pro<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>icientibus quibuscun<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que propulsis per canales cuiuslibet figur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>?
      <lb/>Uno verbo Liquores fluentes viribus quibuscunque
      <lb/>per canales conicos aut cylindricos pressiones ne suas
      <lb/>canalibus communicant per lineas in quovis punc<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>to impulsus perpendiculares? Hoc impossibile
      <lb/>videtur siquidem partes Liquorum fluentium
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> non fluunt per axem canali<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> incidere
      <lb/>possunt ad angulos obliquos in canalis latera vi flu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>xus. Peto itaque ulteriorem hujus rei explicationem addi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tis etiam figuris si opus fuerit. Interim ut parcas mi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>hi pro tot incomodis, et ut mihi imperes in omnibus
      <lb/>quibus Tibi inservire possum rogo.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Amicissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>me mihique favere perge.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1718-06-10">10 Junii
      <lb/>1718.</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p>P. S. Spero quod <rs type="letter">responsion<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti hofft, Johann habe eine Antwort seines Neffen <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus I Bernoulli</rs> erhalten. Ob Nicolaus auf das weitergeleitete Schreiben geantwortet hatte, bleibt offen.</note> acceperis ad <rs type="letter">epistolam</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist wohl der <rs key="B_991170514608105501" type="letter">Brief</rs>, den Johann I Bernoulli am 9. April 1718 an Nicolaus I Bernoulli schrieb. Michelotti legte ihn seinem <rs key="B_991170517055705501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 22. April 1718 bei.</note>
        <lb/>quam me mittere jussisti ad <choice><abbr>Celeber.</abbr><expan>Celeberrimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatum</rs> Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
        <lb/>qui optime valet mihique continu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> summa cum benigni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tate favet. Hanc quam <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimo</expan></choice> Filio Tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Nicolao</rs> mitto
        <lb/><rs type="lostletter">epistolam</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti vertraut Johann einen Brief an dessen Sohn Nicolaus II Bernoulli zur Weitergabe an. Das Schreiben ist bislang nur indirekt bezeugt.</note> Tibi commendo.</p></postscript>
